WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:00.834
♪♪

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:02.211
Mole:
What do you dream about?

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:04.504
Home.

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:05.964
What's that like?

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:09.510
Boy:
I don't know, but I know I
need one.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:13.430
♪♪

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.140
So, what are we doing?

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:16.934
Mole:
We're on a quest for cake!

00:00:16.934 --> 00:00:17.935
♪♪

00:00:17.935 --> 00:00:19.937
Horse:
Well, let's get going then.

00:00:19.937 --> 00:00:25.275
♪♪

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:30.906
You are loved and you bring to
this world things that no one
else can.

00:00:30.906 --> 00:00:32.241
Woah!

00:00:32.241 --> 00:00:34.284
♪♪

00:00:34.284 --> 00:00:35.285
Oh!

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:38.664
♪♪

00:00:38.664 --> 00:00:41.791
Boy:
What's the bravest thing you've
ever said?

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:43.294
♪♪

00:00:43.294 --> 00:00:43.794
Horse:
Help.

00:00:43.794 --> 00:00:44.586
♪♪

00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:46.672
Horse:
Asking for help isn't
giving up,

00:00:46.672 --> 00:00:48.548
♪♪

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:50.926
Horse:
it's refusing to give up.

00:00:50.926 --> 00:00:59.768
♪♪

